215
00:55:29.098 --> 00:55:32.098
And in 2025 this project will not yet be finished.

216
00:55:32.298 --> 00:55:34.298
Believe me, this can take quite some time...

217
00:55:34.498 --> 00:55:36.498
because it is a large project.

218
00:55:36.698 --> 00:55:39.698
But we are going to put the shovel...

219
00:55:39.898 --> 00:55:41.898
together embedded in the ground...

220
00:55:42.098 --> 00:55:44.098
because the project is going to start this year.

221
00:55:44.298 --> 00:55:46.298
Is anyone in agreement with that?

222
00:55:46.498 --> 00:55:48.498
Amen.

223
00:55:48.698 --> 00:55:50.698
So first we have had...

224
00:55:50.898 --> 00:55:52.898
a permit application period.

225
00:55:53.098 --> 00:55:56.098
That has been successfully completed, praise God. Hallelujah.

226
00:55:56.098 --> 00:55:58.098
Now we are going to address the financial aspect.

227
00:55:58.298 --> 00:56:00.298
Now we are going to look together as a church...

228
00:56:00.498 --> 00:56:03.498
how much have we saved, how much do we need...

229
00:56:03.698 --> 00:56:05.698
what do we want to build, in which phase?

230
00:56:05.898 --> 00:56:07.898
That is very important.

231
00:56:08.098 --> 00:56:10.098
Phase 1 is the construction of the children's church.

232
00:56:10.298 --> 00:56:14.298
Phase 2 is the demolition of the old building...

233
00:56:14.498 --> 00:56:16.498
