234
00:56:16.698 --> 00:56:19.698
Phase 3 is the renovation of this hall.

235
00:56:19.898 --> 00:56:21.898
A partition wall will be placed in the middle.

236
00:56:22.098 --> 00:56:24.098
This will be the entrance, that will be the youth room.

237
00:56:24.298 --> 00:56:27.298
Phase 4 is the parking lot that we will then construct.

238
00:56:27.498 --> 00:56:29.498
We want to look as a congregation...

239
00:56:29.698 --> 00:56:31.698
what can we do in which phase...

240
00:56:31.898 --> 00:56:33.898
with what finances, what can we afford...

241
00:56:34.098 --> 00:56:36.098
What do we want to finance?

242
00:56:36.298 --> 00:56:38.298
We are currently discussing this with the board, with the treasurer...

243
00:56:38.498 --> 00:56:40.498
and with the accountants.

244
00:56:40.698 --> 00:56:44.698
Because we want to do something that is good...

245
00:56:44.898 --> 00:56:46.898
stable...

246
00:56:47.098 --> 00:56:49.098
that cannot endanger the congregation...

247
00:56:49.298 --> 00:56:53.298
and what we can do together in faith with God.

248
00:56:53.298 --> 00:56:55.298
I think that is a good combination.

249
00:56:55.498 --> 00:56:57.498
The congregation must not be endangered...

250
00:56:57.698 --> 00:56:59.698
it must be healthy and stable...

251
00:56:59.898 --> 00:57:01.898
and that is why I found it super cool...

252
00:57:02.098 --> 00:57:04.098
that these solid accountants...

253
00:57:04.298 --> 00:57:06.298
told us last Tuesday...

254
00:57:06.498 --> 00:57:08.498
you are doing well.

255
00:57:08.698 --> 00:57:10.698
I find it very nice to hear that.

256
00:57:10.898 --> 00:57:14.898
And I want to invite you on April 11...

257
00:57:15.098 --> 00:57:18.098
we have organized a congregational evening.

258
00:57:18.298 --> 00:57:20.298
On April 11, please mark it in your calendar...

259
00:57:20.298 --> 00:57:22.298
on April 11 we have organized a congregational evening...

260
00:57:22.498 --> 00:57:24.498
to invite everyone...

261
00:57:24.698 --> 00:57:26.698
to come listen to...

262
00:57:26.898 --> 00:57:28.898
what have we all done...

263
00:57:29.098 --> 00:57:31.098
how was that permit application structured...

